    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 266 of the laws of 1986, amending the civil practice law and rules and other laws relating to malpractice and professional medical conduct, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S6026",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6026-2009",
    "coSponsors": {
